        {
          "id": 796977254,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "@johnthacker Do you know why the output for `\"1970-01-01 00:00:00 UTC\"` in the third example below shows as CET? My timezone is WET. DFVM output is using localtime.\n\n```\n% run/dftest 'frame.time == \"1990-01-01 00:00:00 UTC\"'        \nFilter: frame.time == \"1990-01-01 00:00:00 UTC\"\n\nConstants:\n00000 PUT_FVALUE\t\"Jan  1, 1990 00:00:00.000000000 [WET]\" <FT_ABSOLUTE_TIME> -> reg#1\n\nInstructions:\n00000 READ_TREE\t\tframe.time -> reg#0\n00001 IF-FALSE-GOTO\t3\n00002 ANY_EQ\t\treg#0 == reg#1\n00003 RETURN\n\n% run/dftest 'frame.time == \"1980-01-01 00:00:00 UTC\"'\nFilter: frame.time == \"1980-01-01 00:00:00 UTC\"\n\nConstants:\n00000 PUT_FVALUE\t\"Jan  1, 1980 00:00:00.000000000 [WET]\" <FT_ABSOLUTE_TIME> -> reg#1\n\nInstructions:\n00000 READ_TREE\t\tframe.time -> reg#0\n00001 IF-FALSE-GOTO\t3\n00002 ANY_EQ\t\treg#0 == reg#1\n00003 RETURN\n\n% run/dftest 'frame.time == \"1970-01-01 00:00:00 UTC\"'\nFilter: frame.time == \"1970-01-01 00:00:00 UTC\"\n\nConstants:\n00000 PUT_FVALUE\t\"Jan  1, 1970 01:00:00.000000000 [CET]\" <FT_ABSOLUTE_TIME> -> reg#1\n\nInstructions:\n00000 READ_TREE\t\tframe.time -> reg#0\n00001 IF-FALSE-GOTO\t3\n00002 ANY_EQ\t\treg#0 == reg#1\n00003 RETURN\n```",
          "author": {
            "id": 2639362,
            "username": "jvalverde",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "João Valverde",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
